---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="sbp10sizingformula">
  <div class="sbp10sizingformula-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 254" role="img" aria-label="Position sizing worked example: a 100,000,000 VND portfolio, 1% risk and an 8% stop give 12,500,000 VND, capped at 10,000,000 VND, which is 400 shares at 25,000 VND.">
      <text x="20" y="30" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Position size from a loss you accept: one worked line</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tỷ trọng từ mức lỗ bạn chấp nhận: một dòng tính cụ thể</tspan></text>
      <rect x="20" y="56" width="140" height="150" rx="8" class="card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="money" x={90.0} y={84} size={28} />
      <text x="90.0" y="122" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Portfolio</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Danh mục</tspan></text>
      <text x="90.0" y="146" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>100,000,000</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>100.000.000</tspan></text>
      <line x1="164" y1="131" x2="188" y2="131" class="arw" /><polygon points="196,131 187,126 187,136" class="arw-h" />
      <rect x="200" y="56" width="140" height="150" rx="8" class="card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="shield" x={270.0} y={84} size={28} />
      <text x="270.0" y="122" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Risk per idea</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Rủi ro mỗi ý tưởng</tspan></text>
      <text x="270.0" y="146" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>1% = 1,000,000</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1% = 1.000.000</tspan></text>
      <line x1="344" y1="131" x2="368" y2="131" class="arw" /><polygon points="376,131 367,126 367,136" class="arw-h" />
      <rect x="380" y="56" width="140" height="150" rx="8" class="card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="stop" x={450.0} y={84} size={28} />
      <text x="450.0" y="122" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Stop distance</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khoảng cách tới giá cắt</tspan></text>
      <text x="450.0" y="146" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>8% below entry</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>8% dưới giá mua</tspan></text>
      <line x1="524" y1="131" x2="548" y2="131" class="arw" /><polygon points="556,131 547,126 547,136" class="arw-h" />
      <rect x="560" y="56" width="140" height="150" rx="8" class="card" />
      <DiagramIcon name="scale" x={630.0} y={84} size={28} />
      <text x="630.0" y="122" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Size by risk</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Tỷ trọng theo rủi ro</tspan></text>
      <text x="630.0" y="146" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>1,000,000 / 8% =</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1.000.000 / 8% =</tspan></text>
      <text x="630.0" y="163" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>12,500,000</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>12.500.000</tspan></text>
      <line x1="704" y1="131" x2="728" y2="131" class="arw" /><polygon points="736,131 727,126 727,136" class="arw-h" />
      <rect x="740" y="56" width="140" height="150" rx="8" class="card-green" />
      <DiagramIcon name="ok" x={810.0} y={84} size={28} />
      <text x="810.0" y="122" class="h" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Capped at 10%</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chặn ở 10%</tspan></text>
      <text x="810.0" y="146" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>10,000,000 = 400</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>10.000.000 = 400</tspan></text>
      <text x="810.0" y="163" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>shares at 25,000</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cp ở giá 25.000</tspan></text>
      <text x="20" y="236" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>Check: if the stop is hit, the loss is 8% x 10,000,000 = 800,000, which is 0.8% of the portfolio (under 1%).</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Kiểm tra: nếu chạm giá cắt, lỗ 8% x 10.000.000 = 800.000, tức 0,8% danh mục (dưới 1%).</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Size = (portfolio x risk) / stop distance, then cut to the cap. A 25,000 VND stock needs 100-share lots: 400 shares is four lots.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Tỷ trọng = (danh mục x mức rủi ro) / khoảng cách giá cắt, rồi giảm xuống mức trần. Mã giá 25.000 đồng mua theo lô 100: 400 cổ phiếu là bốn lô.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
   .sbp10sizingformula { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .sbp10sizingformula-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
   .sbp10sizingformula svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
   .sbp10sizingformula text { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
   .sbp10sizingformula .t { font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10sizingformula .h { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10sizingformula .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
   .sbp10sizingformula .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
   .sbp10sizingformula .red { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10sizingformula .green { fill: var(--act-2); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10sizingformula .gold { fill: var(--act-1); font-weight: 700; }
   .sbp10sizingformula .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
   .sbp10sizingformula .card-red { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10sizingformula .card-green { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-2); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10sizingformula .card-gold { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
   .sbp10sizingformula .ln { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10sizingformula .axis { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; }
   .sbp10sizingformula .dash { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
   .sbp10sizingformula .arw { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; fill: none; }
   .sbp10sizingformula .arw-h { fill: var(--text-muted); }
   .sbp10sizingformula .bar-red { fill: var(--red); }
   .sbp10sizingformula .bar-green { fill: var(--act-2); }
   .sbp10sizingformula .bar-gold { fill: var(--gold); }
   .sbp10sizingformula .bar-mut { fill: var(--text-faint); }
   .sbp10sizingformula .path-line { fill: none; stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10sizingformula .path-red { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; stroke-linejoin: round; }
   .sbp10sizingformula .dot { fill: var(--act-2); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10sizingformula .dot-red { fill: var(--red); stroke: var(--bg); stroke-width: 1.5; }
   .sbp10sizingformula figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
